Package: c3avcompressor
Version: 0.1.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: C3net Development <support@c3net.internal>
Depends: ffmpeg, libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: intel-media-va-driver | mesa-va-drivers
Homepage: https://github.com/C3net/C3.AVcompressor
Description: C3.AVcompressor - High-performance AI/NPU accelerated video compressor
 C3.AVcompressor by C3net Development is a next-generation media processing
 utility that uses NPUs (Apple Neural Engine, Intel NPU, AMD Ryzen AI) to
 accelerate video compression, splitting, and extraction, outperforming
 standard CUDA FFmpeg pipelines at a fraction of the energy consumption.
